R-CH12 R-CH3 R-CH4 (slice 242, Design Q612): the three other URL forms: `<owner>/<repo>`, `https://github.com/<owner>/<repo>/` (a / at the end), and `https://github.com/<owner>/<repo>/releases/tag/<tag>`. Each run has its own fake list (one build, tag-prefix `fork-`) and its own name. The name is always the operand. The table is appended to config.toml after the earlier tables (a blank line between).
